 owen:[FIC,['At the start of the story, Owen will not speak to his brother.','After the flood, he carries his brother’s tools across the river and says he is sorry.','By the last scene, he is the first to pick up the phone when his brother is late.']],
 nell:[FIC,['Nell longed to enter the town race, but each time she reached the sign-up table her hands went cold, and she imagined everyone watching her fail.']],
