 raven:['Edgar Allan Poe, “The Raven” (1845)',['Once upon a midnight dreary, while I pondered, weak and weary'],1],
 yellow:['Robert Frost, “The Road Not Taken” (1916)',['Two roads diverged in a yellow wood']],
 austen:['Jane Austen, Pride and Prejudice (1813)',['It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single man in possession of a good fortune, must be in want of a wife.']],
