 sonnet18:['William Shakespeare, Sonnet 18 (1609), first four lines',['Shall I compare thee to a summer’s day?','Thou art more lovely and more temperate:','Rough winds do shake the darling buds of May,','And summer’s lease hath all too short a date;'],1],
